  <section id="transport">
    <h2>Getting to the parks</h2>
    <p>The monorail station and the boat dock are the two big advantages here. The boat is the Gold Launch, and official water transportation listings also show it serving the Grand Floridian on the way to Magic Kingdom. A walking path runs to the Transportation and Ticket Center, where you can pick up the EPCOT monorail without riding the resort loop first. Buses leave for the parks the monorail and boat don't cover.</p>
