      <li><strong>Starting Jan 15, 2026:</strong> Disney's 'Ohana page said exterior maintenance may partially or completely block lagoon views from the restaurant. <span class="verify">[verify if still underway]</span></li>
      <li>Island Tower, with the Cove Pool and Moana's Voyage, is open, and official pool listings say Village guests can use them.</li>
    </ul>
